  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "a) 计算偏导数",
      "steps": [
        "展开 $h(x) = \\frac{1}{2}(2x_1^2 - 2x_1 x_2 + 4x_2^2) + 2x_1 + x_2 + 3$",
        "$ = x_1^2 - x_1 x_2 + 2x_2^2 + 2x_1 + x_2 + 3$",
        "$\\dfrac{\\partial h}{\\partial x_1} = 2x_1 - x_2 + 2$",
        "$\\dfrac{\\partial h}{\\partial x_2} = -x_1 + 4x_2 + 1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "b) 求满足条件的点",
      "steps": [
        "$\\dfrac{\\partial h}{\\partial x_1} - \\dfrac{\\partial h}{\\partial x_2} = (2x_1 - x_2 + 2) - (-x_1 + 4x_2 + 1) = 0$",
        "$3x_1 - 5x_2 + 1 = 0$",
        "解得 $x_1 = \\dfrac{5x_2 - 1}{3}$",
        "所有点构成直线 $3x_1 - 5x_2 + 1 = 0$（有无穷多个解）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "c) 唯一解的充要条件",
      "steps": [
        "梯度为零：$Qx + c = 0$，即 $x = -Q^{-1}c$",
        "唯一解存在且唯一  $\\Leftrightarrow$ Q 可逆 $\\Leftrightarrow$ $\\det Q \\neq 0$",
        "因此，必要充分条件是：**Q 为可逆矩阵**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "d) 最小值点的充要条件",
      "steps": [
        "Hessian矩阵 $H = Q$",
        "唯一临界点是最小值点 $\\Leftrightarrow$ H 正定 $\\Leftrightarrow$ Q 正定",
        "Q 正定的充要条件：Q的所有特征值都为正，或等价地，",
        "**Q 对称且 $\\det Q > 0$，$\\text{trace}(Q) > 0$**（对$2 \\times 2$矩阵）"
      ]
    }
  ],
